{"pageProps":{"data":{"news_id":"721","news_catgory":"0","hot_news":"0","news_push":"","news_on_top":"1","news_title":"有感嗎？主計總處：107年勞工年總報酬達73萬1,000元","news_summary":"","image_path":"","news_content":"<p><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;&#10;font-family:&quot;微軟正黑體&quot;,sans-serif\\\">2019-09-30 12:36 </span><span style=\\\"mso-bidi-font-size:&#10;12.0pt;font-family:&quot;微軟正黑體&quot;,sans-serif\\\">經濟日報 記者葉卉軒╱即時報導</span></p>\n\n<p><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;微軟正黑體&quot;,sans-serif\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\\\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;微軟正黑體&quot;,sans-serif\\\">主計總處今（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">30</span>）日發布<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">107</span>年事業人力僱用狀況調查統計顯示，受僱員工年齡逐年提高，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">45</span>歲以上者占了<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">32.9%</span>，比重持續擴大，且平均年齡增至<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">40.1</span>歲，較<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">106</span>年底增加<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">0.1</span>歲，續創新高，而逾六成為大專以上程度，在單一場所服務年資平均為<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">6.1</span>年，與<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">106</span>年持平。</span></p>\n\n<p><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;微軟正黑體&quot;,sans-serif\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\\\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;微軟正黑體&quot;,sans-serif\\\">此外，在勞動報酬部份，主計處的最新調查發現，企業僱用員工時除給付薪資外，另須負擔勞保、健保、退休金提撥等非薪資報酬，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">107</span>年工業及服務業全年受僱員工每人非薪資報酬<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">10</span>萬<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">2,000</span>元，加計薪資報酬<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">62</span>萬<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">9,000</span>元，總報酬<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">73</span>萬<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">1,000</span>元，較<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">106</span>年增加<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">2</span>萬<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">5,000</span>元或<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">3.6%</span>。</span></p>\n\n<p><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;微軟正黑體&quot;,sans-serif\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\\\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;微軟正黑體&quot;,sans-serif\\\">其中，非薪資報酬增加<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">1,985</span>元或<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">2.0%</span>，而薪資報酬中，經常性薪資增加<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">1</span>萬<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">2,372</span>元或<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">2.6%</span>，非經常性薪資（包括加班費及非按月發放之工作、績效、全勤獎金、年節獎金等）增加<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">1</span>萬<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">752</span>元或<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">8.5%</span>。</span></p>\n\n<p><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;微軟正黑體&quot;,sans-serif\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\\\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;微軟正黑體&quot;,sans-serif\\\">主計總處指出，此次調查的非經常性薪資占比為歷年最高，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">107</span>年受僱員工總報酬中經常性薪資、非 經常性薪資及雇主負擔之非薪資報酬所占比重分別為<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">67.2%</span>、<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">18.8%</span>、<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">14.0%, </span>其中非經常性薪資所占比重為歷年最高，較<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">106</span>年增加<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">0.9</span>個百分點，主計總處表示，主要是<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">106</span>年景氣擴張，廠商於<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">107</span>年發放較多年終獎金及績效獎金所致。</span></p>\n\n<p><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;微軟正黑體&quot;,sans-serif\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\\\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;微軟正黑體&quot;,sans-serif\\\">主計總處指出，受僱員工年齡確實逐年提高，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">107</span>年底工業及服務業受僱員工以<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">25</span>歲至<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">44</span>歲者占<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">58.2%</span>最多，但占比逐年下降，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">45</span>歲以上者占<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">32.9%</span>，較<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">6</span>年前增加<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">3.3</span>個百分點，平均年齡增至<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">40.1</span>歲，近六年增加<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">1.1</span>歲。</span></p>\n\n<p><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;微軟正黑體&quot;,sans-serif\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\\\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;微軟正黑體&quot;,sans-serif\\\">此外，受高等教育普及影響，大專以上程度者占<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">63.2%</span>最多，且續呈上升。在單一場所之服務年資以<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">1</span>年至未滿三年者占<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">25.8%</span>最多，未滿<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">1</span>年、<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">5</span>年至未滿<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">10</span>年者均各占<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">18.5%</span>次之，平均服務年資<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">6.1</span>年，與<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">106</span>年持平。</span></p>\n\n<p><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;微軟正黑體&quot;,sans-serif\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\\\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;微軟正黑體&quot;,sans-serif\\\">同時，主計總處調查還發現，因退休而離職者，隨勞保、勞退新制等實施漸近成熟期，以及人口高齡化等影響，屆齡退休人數漸增，近三年都超過<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">10</span>萬人，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">107</span>年退休人數達<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">10.1</span>萬人，較<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">106</span>年減少<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">3,000</span>人，占退出人次的<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">4.7%</span>。</span></p>\n\n<p><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;微軟正黑體&quot;,sans-serif\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\\\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;微軟正黑體&quot;,sans-serif\\\">資料來源<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\">: https://udn.com/news/story/7238/4076765</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:&quot;微軟正黑體&quot;,sans-serif\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n","keyword":"","news_order_id":"0","create_date":"2019-10-01","clk_count":"216"}},"__N_SSG":true}